## Key Learnings
- [Salesforce Basics](ca://s?q=Learning_from_Salesforce_Basics): Learned how Salesforce organizes data into objects and records.
- [Data Modeling](ca://s?q=Learning_from_Data_Modeling): Understood the importance of relationships (lookup vs master-detail).
- [Reports & Dashboards](ca://s?q=Learning_from_Reports_and_Dashboards): Learned how to create dynamic dashboards for real-time insights.
- [Automation Tools](ca://s?q=Learning_from_Automation_Tools): Discovered how Flow can automate complex business processes without code.

## Doubts / Questions
- [Salesforce Basics](ca://s?q=Salesforce_Basics_doubt): How does Salesforce handle data archiving for inactive records?
- [Data Modeling](ca://s?q=Data_Modeling_doubt): When should I prefer junction objects over hierarchical relationships?
- [Reports & Dashboards](ca://s?q=Reports_and_Dashboards_doubt): Can dashboards auto-refresh without manual intervention?
- [Automation Tools](ca://s?q=Automation_Tools_doubt): What are the performance limits of Flow compared to Apex triggers?

